## Embed later, without changing the application now

Once the standalone dashboard is correct, use Looker Studio's **Embed report** workflow and its generated embed URL. Embedding into MiniRTOS is deliberately outside this data-preparation task and should be handled as a separate application change.

## Truthful project description

> Converted existing MiniRTOS JSONL telemetry and analyzer results into a run-level CSV, then built a Looker Studio operational dashboard with KPI scorecards, scenario and status filters, runtime trends, anomaly scores, and detailed fault metrics.
